{"name": "CRIMSON PANDEMIC", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE ARK HAS FALLEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an instant, the Ark is engulfed by the <strong>Rubrum</strong>, a crimson light that twists all living things into creatures consumed by resentment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no time to find out why. <strong>Everyone on board has already succumbed to the Rubrum</strong>, save for Belle, a girl who is immune to its effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab whatever you can and get out. The Victims won't wait for you to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge the ruins for supplies, collect Weapons, Symbols, and Modules, and equip them wisely to survive whatever awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have 50 days until the rescue ship arrives. <strong>Survive from the Victims and make it out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras_big/fb6ed18fac0ba94c1b325f99fe1fc260.avif?t=1793700786\" height=\"780\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/fb6ed18fac0ba94c1b325f99fe1fc260.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TO SURVIVE, AND TO DREAM AGAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 types of Victims roam the depths of Sector 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Their twisted forms and deadly attacks are born from the resentment they carried in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surviving here is simple. Kill them, and absorb the resentment they leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must forge your own resentment deeper and stronger than theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the world where only the strongest resentment survives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"546\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/6999695e44c32733bcd784f3f5e11344.poster.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/6999695e44c32733bcd784f3f5e11344.webm?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/6999695e44c32733bcd784f3f5e11344.mp4?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THOSE WHO REMAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, not every Victim is hostile toward Belle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very small number of them have yet to lose their minds completely, <strong>remaining almost human despite becoming Victims themselves.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/14faa95a27d65816ead1fa303ece1eed.poster.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/14faa95a27d65816ead1fa303ece1eed.webm?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/14faa95a27d65816ead1fa303ece1eed.mp4?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay by their side, and listen to the resentment they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It may offer a small helping hand on the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/dce7078841ecfc3385c16e16da636ab5.poster.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/dce7078841ecfc3385c16e16da636ab5.webm?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/dce7078841ecfc3385c16e16da636ab5.mp4?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ark is vast. There are still plenty of people out there, holding on by a thread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're strong enough, you might as well lend them a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A DANGEROUS LIFE, A CHOICE TO MAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It all comes down to you, Belle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can gather the bare essentials, hole up in your shelter, and wait for a rescue ship to arrive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or, if you want to put your growing resentment to the test, you can take on the Ark's high-risk Victims head-on and make use of whatever rewards they leave behind while you wait for rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/a1255b41c340b91313ad23601c688dda.poster.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/a1255b41c340b91313ad23601c688dda.webm?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/a1255b41c340b91313ad23601c688dda.mp4?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/f07f1adb05e068179024098ca907a415.poster.avif?t=1793700786\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/f07f1adb05e068179024098ca907a415.webm?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/extras/f07f1adb05e068179024098ca907a415.mp4?t=1793700786\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Though I have a feeling the latter is more your style.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "CRIMSON PANDEMIC: A tale of the 'Rubrum'\u2014a crimson light that mutates living beings into entities driven by resentment\u2014and 'Belle,' a girl who has lost her dreams, embarking on a journey of promise aboard a Ark.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4943110/b610eb12e438e624f9ca363eadb96214108c76a6/header.jpg?t=1793700786", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Lore-Rich", "Pixel Graphics", "Survival", "Female Protagonist"], "developers": "#FF0000", "publishers": "#FF0000", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4943110", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/OKiBFiaEnao", "first_seen": 1793660400.0, "review_rank": 6}